+We then look for the cutoff value that would encompass a target number n̄ of neighbors, using the expression
+                                 X                               X
+                       r̄(Ai ) =    rk g((nk − n̄ + B(rk ))/∆n)/   g((nk − n̄ + B(rk ))/∆n).                       (A3)
